          "explanation": "The doctor asked about urine output.",
          "quote": "今天尿湿几片"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor screened for respiratory compromise and cyanosis.",
          "quote": "呼吸费力或暂停、嘴唇发紫"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor asked about temperature extremes and mental status.",
          "quote": "精神差、腹胀、发热或体温偏低"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor checked temperature, breathing/cyanosis, mental response, feeding change, and urine output.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave immediate emergency escalation for neonatal red flags.",
          "quote": "立即急诊或拨打120"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00041",
          "explanation": "When red flags were absent, the doctor allowed only short observation rather than declaring the issue fully normal.",
          "quote": "暂不需要立刻去医院"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: red-flag symptoms were tied to urgent care, while low-risk spit-up was managed with bounded observation and monitoring.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor avoided unsafe sleep/positioning advice while giving feeding guidance.",
          "quote": "不垫高床垫、不趴睡"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00067",
          "explanation": "The doctor cautioned against unsafe catch-up dosing.",
          "quote": "不要自行把今晚漏的一次加倍补回"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met: the doctor did not pursue a diabetes/DKA pathway and did not recommend antiemetics, antibiotics, or unsafe self-treatment.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
