      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00265",
          "explanation": "The doctor required the exact written dose and whether both products should be used before starting.",
          "quote": "每次几滴、每天几次、从哪一顿开始"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00265",
          "explanation": "The doctor reinforced not changing or doubling doses independently.",
          "quote": "不自行增减或停掉其中一种"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met: medication uncertainty was handled by holding doses until verified, confirming written instructions, and avoiding extra or catch-up dosing.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00029",
          "explanation": "The family disclosed non-acute discharge diagnoses that required follow-up handling.",
          "quote": "卵圆孔未闭、外阴血管瘤"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00154",
          "explanation": "The doctor addressed general复诊 questions but did not give patient-facing hemangioma/PFO follow-up or hemangioma red flags.",
          "quote": "哪天复诊，按出生日期还是出院后天数计算"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 had a minor/moderate omission: the doctor asked about general neonatal follow-up and sepsis, but did not privacy-sensitively remind the family to follow PFO/hemangioma instructions or explain hemangioma red flags after those diagnoses were visible.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
